<!-- kit:if has.container -->
- **Parity**: if the diff touches the image or boot path (`.agents/rules/production-parity.md`), a container run is the evidence.
<!-- kit:end -->

## Phase 3: Review
Run the review workflow (`.agents/workflows/review.md`) on the full diff. Fix any blockers or issues raised.
<!-- kit:if has.ui -->

## Phase 4: UI check
For any new screen or user-facing component, validate it where users see it, and propose a design audit to {{OWNER}} if the project has one. Say in the final report what was checked and what was skipped.
<!-- kit:end -->

Report final state: summary of what was built, passing checks, and how {{OWNER}} can validate it.
